            },
            {
              "id": "text_Z_18anvP",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 210,
              "width": 270,
              "height": 166,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:24px;text-align:center;\"><strong>易学强大</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">Python 语法简洁，功能强大，适合初学者快速上手。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "shape_769-Q2Z3",
              "type": "shape",
              "left": 460,
              "top": 170,
              "width": 30,
              "height": 30,
              "path": "M 1 0.5 A 0.5 0.5 0 1 1 0 0.5 A 0.5 0.5 0 1 1 1 0.5 Z",
              "viewBox": [
                1,
                1
              ],
              "fill": "#5b9bd5",
              "fixedRatio": false,
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_QR4vIjE8",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 340,
              "top": 210,
              "width": 270,
              "height": 166,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:24px;text-align:center;\"><strong>课程核心</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">学习 print、变量、输入输出、条件、循环、列表等核心语句。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "shape_K0Dxle52",
              "type": "shape",
              "left": 740,
              "top": 170,
              "width": 30,
              "height": 30,
              "path": "M 1 0.5 A 0.5 0.5 0 1 1 0 0.5 A 0.5 0.5 0 1 1 1 0.5 Z",
              "viewBox": [
                1,
                1
              ],
              "fill": "#5b9bd5",
              "fixedRatio": false,
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_8b0bjyb8",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 620,
              "top": 210,
              "width": 270,
              "height": 166,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:24px;text-align:center;\"><strong>学以致用</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">完成本课程，你将能独立编写简单程序，开启编程之旅。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_eTCQrV8B",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_Ngn-uTs9"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_GL58gFpP",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "同学们，欢迎来到 Python 编程的世界！我是你们的星野老师。今天开始，我们将一起探索这门既简单又强大的编程语言。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_z0YfGrps",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_Z_18anvP"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_jqgWzDE-",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "Python 的语法非常简洁，接近自然语言，特别适合零基础的初学者。你们不用害怕，因为你会发现，写代码有时候就像在写英文小句子。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_oJPnKdUg",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_QR4vIjE8"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_C32Tdjrn",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "而且，我们的课程会走一条极简路线。我们会直接聚焦最核心的语句。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_Ar9iK4b3",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_QR4vIjE8"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_F5jbARJY",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "比如 print 打印、变量存储、输入输出，还有条件判断、循环和列表。所有这些，都是 Python 最常用、最实用的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_EFumT5K2",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_8b0bjyb8"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_2gKqq7nB",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "别看它们基础，组合起来力量可大了。学完这节课，你就能写出真正能运行的小程序。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_HDyNC6HJ",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_8b0bjyb8"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_HPs6YQ1w",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "想象一下，你可以让自己写的代码帮自己算分、画图，甚至做一个简单的互动游戏。这，就是我们这趟旅程的起点。"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": 1780903564431,
      "updatedAt": 1780903564431
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_adGMMwQlyT",
      "stageId": "kA-yc31WJq",
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "第一个程序：print()",
      "order": 2,
      "content": {
        "type": "slide",
        "canvas": {
          "id": "2hyBIbkzBeU2G50Bwp2Fn",
          "viewportSize": 1000,
          "viewportRatio": 0.5625,
          "theme": {
            "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
            "themeColors": [
              "#5b9bd5",
              "#ed7d31",
              "#a5a5a5",
              "#ffc000",
              "#4472c4"
            ],
            "fontColor": "#333333",
            "fontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
            "outline": {
              "color": "#d14424",
              "width": 2,
              "style": "solid"
            },
            "shadow": {
              "h": 0,
              "v": 0,
              "blur": 10,
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "text_e7tNsyUx",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 60,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 70,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:32px;\"><strong>第一个程序：print()</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1a1a1a",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_cRh5g37W",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 165,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 142,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>print() — 在屏幕上显示内容</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;\">print() 是 Python 中最基础的输出函数，用来让程序在控制台显示信息。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>字符串：用引号包裹的文字</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;\">想要显示的文字需要放在引号里（如 '你好' 或 \"你好\"），这种形式称为“字符串”。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>示例</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "shape_49F54ft1",
              "type": "shape",
              "left": 275,
              "top": 342,
              "width": 450,
              "height": 90,
              "path": "M 0 0 L 1 0 L 1 1 L 0 1 Z",
              "viewBox": [
                1,
                1
              ],
              "fill": "#f5f5f5",
              "fixedRatio": false,
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_41tIqnB_",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 295,
              "top": 362,
              "width": 410,
              "height": 49,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:18px;text-align:center;\">print('Hello, 世界')</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_iSTDq2t3",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_e7tNsyUx"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_nF6VSfnk",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "好，现在让我们走进 Python 的第一个程序——print() 函数。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_299hWNKf",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_cRh5g37W"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_cttqF_I6",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "print 是 Python 中最基础的输出函数，它的使命就是在屏幕上显示内容。括号里用引号包裹的文字，我们把它叫做“字符串”，print 会把字符串原样展示出来。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_G71lmfUn",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_41tIqnB_"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_XL2nLBa_",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "来看这个例子：print('Hello, 世界')。运行之后，屏幕上就会出现 Hello, 世界 这几个字，是不是很神奇？"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_fRjX1f1J",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_41tIqnB_"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_bqRNzzcU",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "注意哦，两边的单引号不会显示出来，它们是用来告诉 Python “这里是一段文字” 的标记。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_dwGQuFYK",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_cRh5g37W"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_KFJQnTGU",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "所以，只要把想说的话放在 print 的括号里，用引号包起来，就能让程序替你说出来啦！"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_jdN5xoYg",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_e7tNsyUx"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_QrL38y4q",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "接下来，我们一起动手试试，写出属于自己的第一个 print 语句吧～"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": 1780903564431,
      "updatedAt": 1780903564431
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_sE9AJIGfjZ",
      "stageId": "kA-yc31WJq",
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "变量与数据类型",
      "order": 3,
      "content": {
        "type": "slide",
        "canvas": {
          "id": "u2lA_MPQjdCpeb-dJOFN3",
          "viewportSize": 1000,
          "viewportRatio": 0.5625,
          "theme": {
            "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
            "themeColors": [
              "#5b9bd5",
              "#ed7d31",
              "#a5a5a5",
              "#ffc000",
              "#4472c4"
            ],
            "fontColor": "#333333",
            "fontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
            "outline": {
              "color": "#d14424",
              "width": 2,
              "style": "solid"
            },
            "shadow": {
              "h": 0,
              "v": 0,
              "blur": 10,
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "text_pwxsCYG1",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 60,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 76,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 32px;\"><strong>变量与数据类型</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1a1a1a",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_98Lb3wRv",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 166,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 322,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>1. 什么是变量？</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">变量就像贴了标签的盒子，用来存放数据。</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">通过赋值符号 = 把数据存入变量。</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>2. 基本数据类型</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">- 整数 <strong>int</strong>：如 10, -5</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">- 浮点数 <strong>float</strong>：如 3.14, -0.5</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">- 字符串 <strong>str</strong>：用引号括起来的文本，如 '小明'</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>3. 赋值示例</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">name = '小明' ← 将字符串 '小明' 存入变量 name</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">注意：等号表示赋值，不是数学中的相等。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_5IJqJyOE",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "大家好，我是星野老师，欢迎来到今天的编程课。今天我们要一起探索程序中非常重要的基础——变量与数据类型。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_FklSrnGj",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_pwxsCYG1"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_aX01rAd-",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "变量与数据类型是我们写代码时天天都会接触到的东西。理解了它们，就能让程序帮我们存储和处理各种各样的信息。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_1GM0QnRh",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_98Lb3wRv"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_Ci4UxS6z",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "变量就像一个个贴好标签的小盒子，我们可以把数据放进去，比如名字、年龄、分数。用等号'='就能完成赋值，就像 name = '小明'。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_BBL2xlzs",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "数据有不同类型哦：整数 int 像1、2、3，小数 float 像3.14，还有字符串 str 用来表示文字，比如'你好'。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_IqbwI1fu",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "记住，等号不是数学里的等于，而是'把右边的值交给左边'。就像把礼物放进盒子里一样，是不是很简单？"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_C5g3tsU2",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "接下来，我们会更深入地看看如何灵活运用这些数据类型。大家放轻松，有任何问题随时可以举手，我们慢慢来。"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": 1780903564431,
      "updatedAt": 1780903564431
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_YaxV940cYa",
      "stageId": "kA-yc31WJq",
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "从键盘获取输入：input()",
      "order": 5,
      "content": {
        "type": "slide",
        "canvas": {
          "id": "JhVZ5adZgqA1BKVM6Ju-U",
          "viewportSize": 1000,
          "viewportRatio": 0.5625,
          "theme": {
            "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
            "themeColors": [
              "#5b9bd5",
              "#ed7d31",
              "#a5a5a5",
              "#ffc000",
              "#4472c4"
            ],
            "fontColor": "#333333",
            "fontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
            "outline": {
              "color": "#d14424",
              "width": 2,
              "style": "solid"
            },
            "shadow": {
              "h": 0,
              "v": 0,
              "blur": 10,
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "text_9RgS1Yrm",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 50,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 76,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 36px;\"><strong>从键盘获取输入：input()</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1a1a1a",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_JdeH2jsb",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 160,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 352,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>什么是 input()？</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">从键盘接收用户输入的内置函数。</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>基本语法</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: monospace; background-color: #f0f0f0;\">变量 = input('提示文字')</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">提示文字可选，返回值始终是字符串。</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>示例</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: monospace; background-color: #f0f0f0;\">name = input('你的名字：')</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">输入 “星野” 后，name 的值为 “星野”。</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: monospace; background-color: #f0f0f0;\">age = input('你的年龄：')</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">输入 25 后，age 的值为 “25”（字符串）。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_qhQBzOZN",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_9RgS1Yrm"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_P6dS208c",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "同学们，之前我们学习了如何让程序输出信息。今天我们来探索如何让程序从键盘获取输入，这是交互的关键一步。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_bcmoP_9n",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_JdeH2jsb"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_wOKqs5Cl",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "Python 提供了一个内置函数 input()。当你调用它时，程序会暂停，等待你在控制台输入一些文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_5DpKPcz8",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_JdeH2jsb"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_FtHgd4p_",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "它的基本语法是：变量 = input('提示文字')。提示文字会显示出来，引导用户输入，而输入的内容会被保存到变量里。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_zHCa_7Cp",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_JdeH2jsb"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_YH-3EbYi",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "比如这个例子：name = input('你的名字：')。程序运行到这里，会在屏幕上显示“你的名字：”然后等着你打字，输入的内容就存进了 name 这个变量。"
        },
        {
